  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>If you need to manage Azure App Service on the go,&nbsp;try the preview of <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=azureApps.AzureApps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure App Service Companion</a>. It provides the basic functionality of App Service in an experience that&#39;s optimized for your mobile device, so you don&#39;t have to&nbsp;use your laptop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Read more in our <a href=\"https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/appserviceteam/2016/10/10/azure_app_service_companion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog post</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "If you need to manage Azure App Service on the go, try the preview of Azure App Service Companion . It provides the basic functionality of App Service in an experience that's optimized for your mobile device, so you don't have to use your laptop.\n\nRead more in our blog post ."
  },
